{"seq":1,"slug":"evidence-hierarchy","title":"研究生 循证医学 — 证据等级体系","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/foundations/evidence-hierarchy","wordCount":2049,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-循证医学-证据等级体系\">研究生 循证医学 — 证据等级体系</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>证据等级体系（Evidence Hierarchy）是循证医学的基石框架，通过对不同研究设计产生的证据按照其内在偏倚风险和因果推断强度进行系统分级，为临床决策提供证据质量的参照标准。从 1979 年加拿大预防保健工作组（CTFPHC）首次提出证据分级方案，到当代 GRADE 系统的广泛应用，证据等级体系经历了从简单的设计分类到多维质量评价的范式演进，深刻塑造了现代医学的知识生产和知识应用方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"经典证据金字塔\">经典证据金字塔</h3><p>传统的证据等级体系以&quot;金字塔&quot;模型呈现，将研究设计从低到高排列：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;系统综述/Meta分析&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;随机对照试验 RCT&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;队列研究&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;病例对照研究&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;病例系列/病例报告&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;专家意见/机制推理&quot;]&#10;    \">graph TD\n    A[\"系统综述/Meta分析\"] --&gt; B[\"随机对照试验 RCT\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"队列研究\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"病例对照研究\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"病例系列/病例报告\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"专家意见/机制推理\"]\n    </pre><p>这一层级结构的理论基础是<strong>混杂控制能力的递减</strong>：RCT 通过随机化在已知和未知混杂因素上实现组间均衡，观察性研究只能对已知且已测量的混杂因素进行统计调整，而病例报告和专家意见几乎没有混杂控制。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>证据等级</th>\n<th>代表性设计</th>\n<th>偏倚控制能力</th>\n<th>因果推断强度</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>I 级</td>\n<td>系统综述/Meta分析</td>\n<td>最高（合成多项研究）</td>\n<td>最强</td>\n<td>临床指南制定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>II 级</td>\n<td>RCT</td>\n<td>高（随机化）</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>治疗效果评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>III 级</td>\n<td>队列研究</td>\n<td>中等（统计调整）</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>预后因素研究、暴露-结局关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IV 级</td>\n<td>病例对照研究</td>\n<td>较低（回顾性）</td>\n<td>较弱</td>\n<td>罕见疾病病因探索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V 级</td>\n<td>病例系列</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>新疾病或罕见现象描述</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"经典金字塔的局限与修正\">经典金字塔的局限与修正</h3><p>经典金字塔过度强调研究设计而忽视研究执行质量，存在几个关键问题：</p>\n<p><strong>设计与质量的混淆</strong>：一项设计完美但执行粗糙的 RCT（如高失访率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span>、未盲法、选择性报告结局）可能产生比高质量队列研究更不可靠的证据。</p>\n<p><strong>研究问题的适配性</strong>：并非所有临床问题都适合 RCT 回答——手术技术比较（无法盲法）、罕见不良反应检测（样本量不足）、长期预后评估（RCT 随访有限）在观察性研究中可能获得更有价值的证据。</p>\n<p><strong>系统综述质量的异质性</strong>：并非所有系统综述都处于金字塔顶端——纳入低质量原始研究的系统综述（&quot;garbage in, garbage out&quot;）可能不如单个高质量 RCT 可靠。</p>\n<p>Murad 等人（2016）提出了&quot;修正金字塔&quot;概念，在保留设计分层的同时引入质量升降机制——高质量观察性研究可&quot;升级&quot;到高于低质量 RCT 的位置。</p>\n<h3 id=\"grade-系统-从设计分级到质量评价\">GRADE 系统：从设计分级到质量评价</h3><p>GRADE（Grading of Recommendations, Assessment, Development and Evaluation）系统代表了证据分级方法论的范式转换。GRADE 不是对单个研究分级，而是对&quot;证据体&quot;（body of evidence）——回答特定临床问题的所有相关研究的综合——进行质量评价。</p>\n<p>GRADE 的初始分级仍基于研究设计：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>RCT 起始为<strong>高质量</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⊕</mo><mo>⊕</mo><mo>⊕</mo><mo>⊕</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\oplus\\oplus\\oplus\\oplus)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊕</span><span class=\"mord\">⊕</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>观察性研究起始为<strong>低质量</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⊕</mo><mo>⊕</mo><mo>∘</mo><mo>∘</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\oplus\\oplus\\circ\\circ)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∘</span><span class=\"mord\">∘</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>然后通过五个降级因素和三个升级因素调整最终质量等级：</p>\n<p><strong>降级因素</strong>（每项可降 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 级）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>降级因素</th>\n<th>评估内容</th>\n<th>判断依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>偏倚风险</td>\n<td>原始研究的方法学缺陷</td>\n<td>随机化、盲法、失访、选择性报告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不一致性</td>\n<td>研究间结果的异质性</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I^2 &gt; 50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8532em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span>、置信区间不重叠、效应方向不一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>间接性</td>\n<td>PICO 与研究实际的差异</td>\n<td>人群、干预、对照、结局的差异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不精确性</td>\n<td>效应估计的不确定性</td>\n<td>置信区间跨越临床决策阈值、OIS 不足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发表偏倚</td>\n<td>阳性结果研究被优先发表</td>\n<td>漏斗图不对称、小研究效应</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>升级因素</strong>（仅适用于观察性研究，每项可升 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 级）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>大效应量</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR &gt; 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR &lt; 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>（升 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 级）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR &gt; 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR &lt; 0.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span></span></span></span></span>（升 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 级）</li>\n<li><strong>剂量-反应关系</strong>：明确的梯度效应</li>\n<li><strong>残余混杂方向</strong>：合理的残余混杂只会减弱而非增强观察到的效应</li>\n</ul>\n<p>最终质量分为四个等级：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>GRADE 质量</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mo>⊕</mo><mo>⊕</mo><mo>⊕</mo><mo>⊕</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>高（High）：非常有信心效应估计接近真实</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mo>⊕</mo><mo>⊕</mo><mo>⊕</mo><mo>∘</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>中（Moderate）：中等信心，真实效应可能接近</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mo>⊕</mo><mo>⊕</mo><mo>∘</mo><mo>∘</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>低（Low）：有限信心，真实效应可能有很大不同</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mo>⊕</mo><mo>∘</mo><mo>∘</mo><mo>∘</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>极低（Very Low）：几乎没有信心</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{GRADE 质量} = \\begin{cases} \\oplus\\oplus\\oplus\\oplus &amp; \\text{高（High）：非常有信心效应估计接近真实} \\\\ \\oplus\\oplus\\oplus\\circ &amp; \\text{中（Moderate）：中等信心，真实效应可能接近} \\\\ \\oplus\\oplus\\circ\\circ &amp; \\text{低（Low）：有限信心，真实效应可能有很大不同} \\\\ \\oplus\\circ\\circ\\circ &amp; \\text{极低（Very Low）：几乎没有信心} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GRADE </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">质量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:5.76em;vertical-align:-2.63em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.95em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.592em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.916em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.916em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 916\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V916 H384z M384 0 H504 V916 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.916em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.916em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 916\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V916 H384z M384 0 H504 V916 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.45em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.13em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.13em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊕</span><span class=\"mord\">⊕</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊕</span><span class=\"mord\">∘</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∘</span><span class=\"mord\">∘</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∘</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∘</span><span class=\"mord\">∘</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.63em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.13em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.13em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">高（</span><span class=\"mord\">High</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）：非常有信心效应估计接近真实</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">中（</span><span class=\"mord\">Moderate</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）：中等信心，真实效应可能接近</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">低（</span><span class=\"mord\">Low</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）：有限信心，真实效应可能有很大不同</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">极低（</span><span class=\"mord\">Very Low</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）：几乎没有信心</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.63em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"从证据质量到推荐强度\">从证据质量到推荐强度</h3><p>GRADE 系统将证据质量与推荐强度明确分离。推荐强度（强推荐 vs. 弱/条件推荐）由四个因素共同决定：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>证据质量</strong>：高质量证据更支持强推荐</li>\n<li><strong>利弊平衡</strong>：获益明显超过危害时倾向强推荐</li>\n<li><strong>患者价值观与偏好</strong>：价值观一致性高时倾向强推荐</li>\n<li><strong>资源利用</strong>：合理的资源消耗支持强推荐</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这意味着低质量证据也可能支持强推荐（如致命性疾病缺乏治疗替代时），高质量证据也可能仅支持弱推荐（如利弊平衡微妙时）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"特殊场景的证据评价\">特殊场景的证据评价</h3><p><strong>网状 Meta 分析证据</strong>：CINeMA（Confidence in Network Meta-Analysis）框架将 GRADE 原则扩展到网状 Meta 分析，增加了对间接比较一致性的评估。</p>\n<p><strong>诊断准确性研究</strong>：GRADE 对诊断研究的评价采用配对设计（同时评估敏感度和特异度），横断面诊断准确性研究起始为高质量。</p>\n<p><strong>预后研究</strong>：高质量前瞻性队列研究在 GRADE 框架下起始为高质量（而非 RCT 以外默认低质量），反映了预后研究中 RCT 并非最优设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>某指南制定小组在评价一项药物预防骨折的证据体时发现：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 项 RCT（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=5,200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span>）显示相对风险降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.72</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR = 0.72</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.72</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>0.58</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">95\\% CI: 0.58</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.58</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.90</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.90</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.90</span></span></span></span></span>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I^2 = 12\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12%</span></span></span></span></span>；但所有试验均由制药公司资助且存在选择性结局报告嫌疑。请运用 GRADE 方法评估该证据体的质量等级，并逐一论证每个降级因素的判断。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>一项大型观察性队列研究（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = 200,000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span></span>）发现吸烟与肺癌的调整后风险比为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">HR = 15.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15.2</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>12.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">95\\% CI: 12.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12.8</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>18.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">18.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18.1</span></span></span></span></span>），存在明确的剂量-反应关系。尽管作为观察性研究起始质量为&quot;低&quot;，请论证在 GRADE 框架下该证据是否可以升级，以及升级后的最终质量等级。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>为什么 GRADE 系统不推荐使用 Oxford CEBM 的传统证据等级（1a-5）直接制定推荐？请从方法论角度比较两种体系的核心差异。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>在罕见病领域，RCT 往往不可行（如全球患者数仅数百人）。请讨论在这种情境下如何调整证据评价框架，以及 FDA/EMA 为罕见病审批接受哪些非传统证据类型。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Guyatt, G.H. et al. (2008)</strong>：&quot;GRADE: An Emerging Consensus on Rating Quality of Evidence and Strength of Recommendations&quot;，BMJ——GRADE 系统的权威综述</li>\n<li><strong>Murad, M.H. et al. (2016)</strong>：&quot;New Evidence Pyramid&quot;，Evidence-Based Medicine——修正金字塔的提出</li>\n<li><strong>Schünemann, H.J. et al. (2022)</strong>：《GRADE Handbook》——GRADE 方法学的完整操作手册</li>\n<li><strong>Howick, J. et al. (2011)</strong>：Oxford CEBM Levels of Evidence 2011——Oxford 证据分级体系更新版</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>证据等级体系从经典金字塔的设计导向发展为 GRADE 系统的多维质量评价，反映了循证医学对&quot;什么构成好证据&quot;这一根本问题的认识深化。GRADE 通过系统化的降级和升级机制，将证据评价从主观判断转变为透明、可复现的结构化过程，并将证据质量与推荐强度明确分离，为临床指南制定提供了当前最严谨的方法论框架。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 循证医学 — 证据等级体系","id":"研究生-循证医学-证据等级体系"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"经典证据金字塔","id":"经典证据金字塔"},{"level":3,"text":"经典金字塔的局限与修正","id":"经典金字塔的局限与修正"},{"level":3,"text":"GRADE 系统：从设计分级到质量评价","id":"grade-系统-从设计分级到质量评价"},{"level":3,"text":"从证据质量到推荐强度","id":"从证据质量到推荐强度"},{"level":3,"text":"特殊场景的证据评价","id":"特殊场景的证据评价"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"研究生 循证医学 — 临床问题构建","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/foundations/clinical-question-formulation"}}